return {{"操作与返回", "Controls & Home", "单击切换选项，双击确认。三击返回桌面。长按说话，松开发送。返回上层可选中返回。", "Click to move the selection; double-click to open. Triple-click for Home. Hold to speak; release to send. Select Back for the previous page."}, {"对话与修改应用", "Talk & change apps", "按住用户键说话。应用可接管语音；否则进入默认对话。可要求翻页、打开应用，或修改当前应用。", "Hold the user key to talk. An app can handle speech; otherwise WishOS opens Talk. Ask to turn a page, open a tool, or change the current app."}, {"回复与会话", "Replies & chats", "可切换文字或语音回复。语音也保留文字。会话菜单可查看已有对话、新建会话，或返回之前的会话。", "Choose Text or Voice replies; speech keeps the text too. Use Chats to open a previous conversation or start a new one."}, {"网络与手机设置", "Network & phone setup", "在网络设置查看地址。手机连接同一网络后可访问后台；没有可用网络时可开启设备配网热点。", "Find the device address in Network. Open it on a phone on the same network. Without a network, use the device setup hotspot."}, {"应用与文件", "Apps & files", "本地工具可离线打开；远程动作需要联网。应用保存在设备允许的存储中，有卡槽时可用 SD 扩展。", "Saved tools can run offline; remote actions need a connection. Apps use available device storage. A card slot, when present, allows SD expansion."}}
